      "start_seconds": 198.3,
      "end_seconds": 212.04,
      "duration_seconds": 13.74,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 99 percent, pressure 116 over 68, temperature 36.7, BMI works out to 29.9, pulse 77, weight 70 kilos, respiratory rate 15, height 153 centimetres."
