      "start_seconds": 247.58,
      "end_seconds": 275.88,
      "duration_seconds": 28.3,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. What I'm giving you is levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. That's for contraception. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two."
    },
